<title>GERMANY: GRUNDIG [GRNG.CN] REPORTS 631 MLN DM 1996 LOSS.</title>
<headline>GRUNDIG [GRNG.CN] REPORTS 631 MLN DM 1996 LOSS.</headline>
<dateline>FUERTH, Germany 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Embattled German audio-visual equipment manufacturer Grundig AG [GRNG.CN] said on Monday it lost a record 631 million marks ($368.4 million) in 1996, compared with a 598 million mark loss the year before.</p>
<p>In March, the company estimated the 1996 loss at 553 million marks.</p>
</text>
